     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Minutes",
     "texto": [
      "**Proces-verbal** is \"minutes\" or \"written record of a meeting\". **A consemna** means \"to put on record\" a decision or a fact."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Follow-up",
     "texto": [
      "**În urma ședinței** means \"following the meeting\". **Termen convenit** is the deadline that the parties have agreed."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
